COMMENT ON TABLE DIM_ACTIVITYCODE IS 'References the activity codes that can be performed on Aeroplan member accounts.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYCODE.ACTIVITYCODESID IS 'Surrogate key that uniquely identifies each record in the ActivityCode dimension';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYCODE.ACTIVITYCODEHASHKEY IS 'Hash key derived from the natural key (ActivityCode) for record matching';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYCODE.ACTIVITYCODE IS 'Unique code identifying the activity type (e.g., AC=Accrual, BR=Cobrand Benefit, TC=Tier Change, TP=Points Transfer)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYCODE.ACTIVITYCODEDESCRIPTION IS 'Descriptive name of the activity (e.g., "Accrual Activity", "Tier Change", "Points Transfer", "Benefit Selection")';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYCODE.CANCELLATIONALLOWEDFLAG IS 'Flag indicating if member can cancel this activity.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYCODE.MEMBERSERVICEFLAG IS 'Flag indicating if activity is a member service.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYCODE.PROGRAMCODE IS 'Loyalty program the activity belongs to (ACMM=Million Mile Club, ACRP=Aeroplan Program)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYCODE.ADHOCFLAG IS 'Flag indicating if adhoc execution is allowed.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYCODE.CURRENTFLAG IS 'Indicates if the record is current (1) or historical/superseded (0)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYCODE.DELETEDFLAG IS 'Indicates if the record is logically deleted (1) or active (0)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYCODE.SCDSTARTDATETIME IS 'UTC timestamp when the record became effective (SCD Type 2)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYCODE.SCDENDDATETIME IS 'UTC timestamp when the record was superseded (SCD Type 2)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYCODE.LATEARRIVINGFLAG IS 'Indicates if record was created by fact load (1) vs normal dimension load (0)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYCODE.TYPE1HASH IS 'Hash of all Type 1 attributes for change detection';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYCODE.TYPE2HASH IS 'Hash of all Type 2 attributes for change detection';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYCODE.CREATEDBATCHLOGID IS 'ID of the ETL batch that originally created this record';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYCODE.UPDATEDBATCHLOGID IS 'ID of the ETL batch that last updated or expired this record';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYCODE.UPDATETYPE IS 'Audit field indicating change type (new insert, type 1 update, etc.)';


COMMENT ON TABLE DIM_ACTIVITYSOURCE IS "References activity source used to register Aeroplan member's activities.";
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYSOURCE.ACTIVITYSOURCESID IS 'Surrogate key that uniquely identifies each record in the ActivitySource dimension';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYSOURCE.ACTIVITYSOURCECODE IS 'Code identifying the activity source (A=Manual Flight, D=DCS, F=Retro Forced, M=Manual, P=Partner Feed, R=Retro Claim, S=System, T=Telegraph, W=Web, U=Unknown, etc.)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYSOURCE.ACTIVITYSOURCEDESCRIPTION IS 'Descriptive name of the source (e.g., "Manual Flight", "DCS", "Partner Feed", "Retro Claim", "System", "Web", "Manual Point Adjustment")';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYSOURCE.CURRENTFLAG IS 'Indicates if the record is current (1) or historical/superseded (0)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYSOURCE.DELETEDFLAG IS 'Indicates if the record is logically deleted (1) or active (0)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYSOURCE.SCDSTARTDATETIME IS 'UTC timestamp when the record became effective (SCD Type 2)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYSOURCE.SCDENDDATETIME IS 'UTC timestamp when the record was superseded (SCD Type 2)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYSOURCE.LATEARRIVINGFLAG IS 'Indicates if record was created by fact load (1) vs normal dimension load (0)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYSOURCE.TYPE1HASH IS 'Hash of all Type 1 attributes for change detection';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYSOURCE.TYPE2HASH IS 'Hash of all Type 2 attributes for change detection';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYSOURCE.CREATEDBATCHLOGID IS 'ID of the ETL batch that originally created this record';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYSOURCE.UPDATEDBATCHLOGID IS 'ID of the ETL batch that last updated or expired this record';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYSOURCE.UPDATETYPE IS 'Audit field indicating change type (new insert, type 1 update, etc.)';

COMMENT ON TABLE DIM_ACTIONREASON IS 'List of actions being performed on Aeroplan member accounts.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIONREASON.ACTIONREASONSID IS 'Surrogate key that uniquely identifies each record in the ActionReason dimension';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIONREASON.ACTIONREASONHASHKEY IS 'Hash key derived from the natural key (ActionReasonCode) for record matching';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIONREASON.ACTIONREASONCODE IS 'Alphanumeric code (1-4 characters) that uniquely identifies an action reason';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIONREASON.ACTIONREASONDESCRIPTION IS 'Descriptive text explaining the action reason, corresponds to the ActionReasonCode';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIONREASON.CURRENTFLAG IS 'Indicates if the record is current (1) or historical/superseded (0)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIONREASON.DELETEDFLAG IS 'Indicates if the record is logically deleted (1) or active (0)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIONREASON.SCDSTARTDATETIME IS 'UTC timestamp when the record became effective (SCD Type 2)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIONREASON.SCDENDDATETIME IS 'UTC timestamp when the record was superseded by a newer version (SCD Type 2)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIONREASON.LATEARRIVINGFLAG IS 'Indicates if the record was created by a fact load (1) rather than normal dimension load (0)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIONREASON.TYPE1HASH IS 'Hash of all Type 1 attributes (overwritten on change) for change detection';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIONREASON.TYPE2HASH IS 'Hash of all Type 2 attributes (versioned on change) for change detection';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIONREASON.CREATEDBATCHLOGID IS 'ID of the ETL batch that originally created this record';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIONREASON.UPDATEDBATCHLOGID IS 'ID of the ETL batch that last updated or expired this record';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIONREASON.UPDATETYPE IS 'Audit field indicating the type of change (new insert, type 1 update, etc.)';


COMMENT ON TABLE DIM_ACTIVITYSTATUS IS 'References the possible activity statuses an Aerolan point transaction.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYSTATUS.ACTIVITYSTATUSSID IS 'Surrogate key that uniquely identifies each Activity Status record in the dimension';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYSTATUS.ACTIVITYSTATUSCODE IS 'Unique 2-character code representing each activity status type';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYSTATUS.ACTIVITYSTATUSDESCRIPTION IS 'Description of the status (e.g., Cancelled, Processed, Suspended)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYSTATUS.CURRENTFLAG IS 'Indicates if record is current (1) or historical (0) in SCD Type 2';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYSTATUS.DELETEDFLAG IS 'Indicates if record is soft-deleted (1) or active (0)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYSTATUS.SCDSTARTDATETIME IS 'UTC timestamp when the record became effective';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYSTATUS.SCDENDDATETIME IS 'UTC timestamp when another record superseded this one';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYSTATUS.LATEARRIVINGFLAG IS 'Indicates if record was created by a fact load (1) vs normal dimension load (0)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYSTATUS.TYPE1HASH IS 'Hash of all Type 1 (overwrite) attributes for change detection';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYSTATUS.TYPE2HASH IS 'Hash of all Type 2 (historical) attributes for change detection';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYSTATUS.CREATEDBATCHLOGID IS 'ETL batch ID that created this record';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYSTATUS.UPDATEDBATCHLOGID IS 'ETL batch ID that last updated or expired this record';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYSTATUS.UPDATETYPE IS 'Audit field tracking the type of change (new insert, type 1 update, etc.)';


COMMENT ON TABLE DIM_ACTIVITYTYPE IS "References the types of activities that can be performed on an Aeroplan member's account.";
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYTYPE.ACTIVITYTYPESID IS 'Surrogate key that uniquely identifies each Activity Type record in the dimension';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYTYPE.ACTIVITYTYPECODE IS 'Unique code representing the type of activity (e.g., RD=Redemption, CA=Cancellation, EP=Expire Points, MU=Manual Update, etc.)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYTYPE.ACTIVITYTYPEDESCRIPTION IS 'Description of the activity type (e.g., Cancellation Activity, Pool Activity, Member Enrolment Activity, Redemption, etc.)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYTYPE.CURRENTFLAG IS 'Indicates if record is current (1) or historical (0) in SCD Type 2';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYTYPE.DELETEDFLAG IS 'Indicates if record is soft-deleted (1) or active (0)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYTYPE.SCDSTARTDATETIME IS 'UTC timestamp when the record became effective';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYTYPE.SCDENDDATETIME IS 'UTC timestamp when another record superseded this one';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYTYPE.LATEARRIVINGFLAG IS 'Indicates if record was created by a fact load (1) vs normal dimension load (0)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYTYPE.TYPE1HASH IS 'Hash of all Type 1 (overwrite) attributes for change detection';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYTYPE.TYPE2HASH IS 'Hash of all Type 2 (historical) attributes for change detection';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYTYPE.CREATEDBATCHLOGID IS 'ETL batch ID that created this record';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYTYPE.UPDATEDBATCHLOGID IS 'ETL batch ID that last updated or expired this record';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_ACTIVITYTYPE.UPDATETYPE IS 'Audit field tracking the type of change (new insert, type 1 update, etc.)';



COMMENT ON TABLE DIM_AIRPORT IS 'References all airports and other transport locations like train stations. It tells what and where an airport is (codes, names, geography), how it it is classified (tier, type, category, Europe/overseas) and other detailed information.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_AIRPORT.AIRPORTSID IS 'Unique surrogate key identifying each airport/location record in the dimension table';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_AIRPORT.AIRPORTCODEIATA IS 'IATA (International Air Transport Association) 3-letter code uniquely identifying the airport/location (e.g., BXQ, FRA, DEL)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_AIRPORT.CITYCODE IS 'IATA city code associated with the airport location, typically same as airport code for single-airport cities';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_AIRPORT.LOCATIONNAME IS 'Full name of the airport, rail station, or transportation hub (e.g., "FRANKFURT INTERNATIONAL APT")';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_AIRPORT.TIER IS 'Classification tier for the airport. Tier 1 airports are the largest hubs (e.g., YYZ, YUL, YVR, major international hubs). Tier 2, 3 and others are progressively smaller, less strategic airports.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_AIRPORT.COUNTRYCODE IS 'ISO 2-letter country code where the airport is located (e.g., DE, ID, SA)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_AIRPORT.COUNTRYNAME IS 'Full name of the country where the airport is located';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_AIRPORT.TIMEDIVISIONINACOUNTRY IS 'Time zone region or administrative division within a country (e.g., 01, 02, 03, 04)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_AIRPORT.JURISDICTIONCODE IS 'Code representing the legal or administrative jurisdiction of the airport (e.g., state, province code)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_AIRPORT.JURISDICTIONNAME IS 'Name of the legal or administrative jurisdiction (e.g., “Ontario”, “Quebec”)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_AIRPORT.CITYNAME IS 'Name of the city where the airport is located';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_AIRPORT.EUROPEINDICATOR IS 'Flag indicating whether the location is within Europe';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_AIRPORT.LONGITUDE IS 'Geographic longitude coordinate of the airport location';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_AIRPORT.LATITUDE IS 'Geographic latitude coordinate of the airport location';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_AIRPORT.TERMINALS IS 'List of terminal identifiers available at the airport';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_AIRPORT.LOCATIONCATEGORY IS 'Code representing the category of the location (e.g., airport, heliport, seaport)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_AIRPORT.LOCATIONCATEGORYDESCRIPTION IS 'Full description of the location category';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_AIRPORT.LOCATIONTYPE IS 'Type code: A=Airport, R=Rail Station, B=Bus Station, H=Harbour, O/V=Other transport';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_AIRPORT.LOCATIONTYPENAME IS 'Full name of the location type';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_AIRPORT.INACTIVEINDICATOR IS 'Flag indicating if the airport/location is inactive';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_AIRPORT.ARRIVALSCANNINGFLAG IS 'Flag indicating if arrival scanning services are available at this location';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_AIRPORT.ISOVERSEASPAYIFS IS 'Flag indicating if overseas pay IFS (In-Flight Service) is applicable at this location';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_AIRPORT.ISOVERSEASPAYPILOT IS 'Flag indicating if overseas pay pilot program is applicable at this location';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_AIRPORT.ISOVERSEASFTLIFS IS 'Flag indicating if overseas FTL (Flight Time Limitation) IFS is applicable';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_AIRPORT.ISOVERSEASFTLPILOT IS 'Flag indicating if overseas FTL pilot program is applicable';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_AIRPORT.CURRENTFLAG IS 'Indicates if record is current (1) or historical (0) in SCD Type 2';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_AIRPORT.DELETEDFLAG IS 'Indicates if record is soft-deleted (1) or active (0)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_AIRPORT.SCDSTARTDATETIME IS 'UTC timestamp when the record became effective';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_AIRPORT.SCDENDDATETIME IS 'UTC timestamp when another record superseded this one';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_AIRPORT.LATEARRIVINGFLAG IS 'Indicates if record was created by a fact load (1) vs normal dimension load (0)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_AIRPORT.TYPE1HASH IS 'Hash of all Type 1 (overwrite) attributes for change detection';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_AIRPORT.TYPE2HASH IS 'Hash of all Type 2 (historical) attributes for change detection';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_AIRPORT.CREATEDBATCHLOGID IS 'ETL batch ID that created this record';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_AIRPORT.UPDATEDBATCHLOGID IS 'ETL batch ID that last updated or expired this record';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DIM_AIRPORT.UPDATETYPE IS 'Audit field tracking the type of change (new insert, type 1 update, etc.)';
